    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your tactical robot companion advances into a Burly or Deft robot companion. Choose one path. It gains one Advanced Customization of your choice, and it can use its chassis's Advanced Maneuver.</p><p><strong>Burly</strong> Your companion can optionally increase its size by one category. It gains a +2 Strength modifier and a +1 modifier to Dexterity, Constitution, and Wisdom. It becomes an expert in Athletics, deals 3 additional damage with melee Strikes, and its attacks become magical.</p><p><strong>Deft</strong> Your companion gains a +2 Dexterity modifier and a +1 modifier to Strength, Constitution, and Wisdom. Choose Acrobatics or Stealth; your companion becomes an expert in that skill. Its attacks become magical.</p>"
    },
    "level": { "value": 8 },
    "prerequisites": { "value": [{ "value": "Tactical Drone" }] },
